# Enthroned OS - Enthroned Launcher (org.enthroned.launcher), pt_BR.
# Compiled to /usr/share/locale/pt_BR/LC_MESSAGES/plasma_applet_org.enthroned.launcher.mo
# at image build time (build_files/build.sh).
#
# Lote 11B (H4/H5): the .mo name IS the translation domain, and Plasma derives
# a plasmoid's domain from libplasma's Plasma::Applet::translationDomain():
# "plasma_applet_" + KPlugin.Id. The previous file name (org.enthroned.launcher.po)
# compiled to a domain the launcher QML never consults, so every i18n() call
# fell back to the English source strings ("Pinned", "All applications",
# "Places", "Search this computer", "Session and power" — H4 P2 / H5 herdado).
# The QML source strings are the English messages; ki18n loads this catalog
# according to the session language (plasma-localerc, System Settings >
# Language & Region).
#
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
